@startuml rbac_matrix
' DermaTrack — RBAC permission matrix (extra figure).
' Enforced by Postgres RLS: is_demo_doctor()=role 'doctor', is_admin()=role 'admin',
' has_active_break_glass(); doctor access additionally requires patient consent.
title DermaTrack RBAC permission matrix (RLS-enforced)
legend center
|= Capability |= Patient |= Doctor |= Admin |
| Own scans + images (CRUD) | Yes | - | - |
| Own clinical intake (CRUD) | Yes | read* | - |
| Own notes / plan / prescriptions | read | write* | - |
| Messages | own thread | consenting* | - |
| Grant/revoke doctor consent | Yes | - | - |
| Read consenting patients' records | - | Yes* | - |
| Manage users / roles | - | - | Yes |
| Activate / deactivate accounts | - | - | Yes |
| Read audit log | self/related | - | all |
| Break-glass (open/revoke) | - | - | Yes |
| Read patient rows via break-glass | - | - | active session |
| Edit / unsend own message | own | own | - |
| Moderate chats (read all / remove message) | - | - | Yes |
| Restrict user messaging | - | - | Yes |
|---
| * = only when patient consent (shared_with_doctor = true) ||||
endlegend
@enduml
